# Token Efficiency & Modular Architecture

- **Line Limit**: Every file must be under 300 lines.
- **Refactor Trigger**: If a file reaches 250 lines, automatically propose splitting it.
- **Separation of Concerns**:
  - Move complex logic to `@/hooks`.
  - Move types to `@/types`.
  - Move API/Crypto calls to `@/services`.
- **Output Style**: Use Search/Replace blocks. Never rewrite an entire file for a small change.
- **No Yapping**: Do not explain code unless I ask "why". Just show the code.
- **MCP**: Use my mcp into connect with my backend and change data table etc
- **Deploy Function**: when you deploy function turn off verify jwt --jwt
